"Minuscule pistol and rifle ammunition, for target practice or turn of the "
"century sidearms.  Sold in great quantities preceding the riots.  Jacketed "
"Hollow Points are defensive/duty projectiles that are more destructive to "
"tissue than plain ball ammunition, and slightly reduce overpenetration "
"concerns."
msgstr ""

