msgstr ""

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "pair of stylish corrective glasses"
msgid_plural "pairs of stylish corrective glasses"
msgstr[0] "時髦矯正眼鏡"

#. ~ Description for pair of stylish corrective glasses
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A pair of stylish glasses for the near-sighted.  The concave lenses diffuse "
"the sunlight, rendering them useless for starting fires."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "pair of stylish reading glasses"
msgid_plural "pairs of stylish reading glasses"
msgstr[0] "時髦老花眼鏡"

#. ~ Description for pair of stylish reading glasses
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A pair of stylish glasses for the far-sighted.  Useless for anyone else."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "pair of stylish bifocal sunglasses"
msgid_plural "pairs of stylish bifocal sunglasses"
msgstr[0] "時尚雙焦點墨鏡"

#. ~ Description for pair of stylish bifocal sunglasses
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A pair of stylish bifocal sunglasses for keeping the glare out of the eyes "
"of those who are both near-sighted and far-sighted."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "pair of stylish corrective sunglasses"
msgid_plural "pairs of stylish corrective sunglasses"
msgstr[0] "時尚矯正墨鏡"

#. ~ Description for pair of stylish corrective sunglasses
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A pair of stylish sunglasses, looks good while keeping the glare out of the "
"eyes of those who are near-sighted."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "pair of stylish reading sunglasses"
msgid_plural "pairs of stylish reading sunglasses"
msgstr[0] "時髦老花墨鏡"

#. ~ Description for pair of stylish reading sunglasses
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A pair of stylish sunglasses, looks good while keeping the glare out of the "
"eyes of those who are far-sighted.  Useless for anyone else."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "pair of transition bifocal glasses"
msgid_plural "pairs of transition bifocal glasses"
msgstr[0] "變色雙焦點眼鏡"

#. ~ Description for pair of transition bifocal glasses
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A pair of transition bifocal glasses for those who are both near-sighted and"
" far-sighted.  Contains photochromic dyes causing the lens to activate, or "
"darken, when exposed to ultraviolet rays from sunlight.  When the UV light "
"diminishes, the lenses fade back."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "pair of transition corrective glasses"
msgid_plural "pairs of transition corrective glasses"
msgstr[0] "變色矯正眼鏡"

#. ~ Description for pair of transition corrective glasses
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A pair of transition glasses for the near-sighted.  Contains photochromic "
"dyes causing the lens to activate, or darken, when exposed to ultraviolet "
"rays from sunlight.  When the UV light diminishes, the lenses fade back."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "pair of transition reading glasses"
msgid_plural "pairs of transition reading glasses"
msgstr[0] "變色老花眼鏡"

#. ~ Description for pair of transition reading glasses
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A pair of glasses for the far-sighted.  Useless for anyone else.  Contains "
"photochromic dyes causing the lens to activate, or darken, when exposed to "
"ultraviolet rays from sunlight.  When the UV light diminishes, the lenses "
"fade back."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "pair of stylish transition bifocal glasses"
msgid_plural "pairs of stylish transition bifocal glasses"
msgstr[0] "時髦變色雙焦點眼鏡"

#. ~ Description for pair of stylish transition bifocal glasses
