"A t-shirt with a picture of the Tux mascot on it.  Underneath it says \"You "
"wouldn't buy a car with the hood welded shut.\""
msgstr "一件有企鵝吉祥物圖案的 T 恤。他的下面寫著 \"你不會買一台引擎蓋被焊死的車。\""

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A t-shirt with a picture of Tux, the Linux mascot!  It says \"You wouldn't "
"buy a car with the hood welded shut.\""
msgstr "一件有企鵝圖案的 T 恤, Linux 的吉祥物! 它說 \"你不會買一台引擎蓋被焊死的車。\""

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A t-shirt with the Ubuntu logo on it, underneath it says \"Ubuntu is a South"
" African word for 'I can't configure Debian'\""
msgstr "一件有 Ubuntu 標誌的 T 恤, 下面寫著 \"Ubuntu 是一個南非單字, 意思是 '我不會設置我的 Debian'\""

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
