msgid "tour t-shirt"
msgid_plural "tour t-shirts"
msgstr[0] "旅遊T恤"

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A short-sleeved cotton shirt with a death metal band's spidery, "
"indecipherable logo printed on the front."
msgstr "這款短袖棉質襯衫飾有死亡金屬樂團的蜘蛛，正面印有難以辨認的標誌。"

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A short-sleeved cotton shirt with a muscle-bound, long-haired man printed on"
" the front.  He is riding a red dragon and wielding a flaming sword with "
"malicious glee."
msgstr "這款短袖棉質襯衫正面印有肌肉發達的長髮男士。 他騎乘著一條紅色的龍，揮舞著一把惡毒的火焰劍。"

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A short-sleeved cotton shirt with a gore-spattered, guitar-playing zombie "
"printed on the front.  It's rather tasteless in light of current events."
msgstr "這款短袖棉質襯衫的正面印有鍍金、正在彈吉他的殭屍。身處大災難的當下，這太稀疏平常了。 "

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A short-sleeved cotton shirt with a pattern of complex geometric shapes and "
"transcendental imagery printed on the front."
msgstr "這款短袖棉質襯衫的正面印有超凡意象的複雜幾何造型圖案。"

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A short-sleeved cotton shirt with an image of a woman's face in portrait "
"printed on the front.  She is wearing a large blue mohawk, her face is set "
"in a snarl."
msgstr "這款短袖棉質襯衫的正面印有女性臉型。她有著莫霍克髮型，而且看起來正在咆哮。"

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A short-sleeved black cotton shirt with a stylized representation of a radio"
" wave printed on the front."
msgstr "這款短袖黑色棉質襯衫的正面印有無線電波紋樣式。"

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A short-sleeved cotton shirt, it's front showing an image of an upside-down "
"American flag covered in anarchist graffiti, its edges frayed and burned."
msgstr "這款短袖棉質襯衫的正面印有一幅顛倒的美國國旗，上面塗滿了無政府主義者的塗鴉。襯衫邊緣磨損且燒焦。"

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A short-sleeved cotton shirt with an AK-47 on the front.  It is held up by a"
" clenched fist around its forestock, the fingers covered in crude looking "
"tattoos."
msgstr "這款短袖棉質襯衫的正面印有AK-47的圖樣。它被一個握緊的拳頭抓著它的前托舉起來，手指上還刺有粗糙的紋身。"

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
