"processing, eliminating most if not all harmful ingredients.  Normal "
"cannabis contains around 20%THC, this distillate should be around 88%THC.  "
"Can be smoked in a bowl, used in a dab pen, or used to make distillate "
"cartridges."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/COMESTIBLE_from_json.py
msgid "high quality distillate cartridge"
msgid_plural "high quality distillate cartridges"
