"A bulky and heavy clay pot with a waterproofed hide lid, meant to store "
"water, but can carry other liquids in a pinch."
msgstr "一個笨重的陶製大甕， 配有防水的皮蓋子。可用來裝水， 有需要時也可拿來裝其他液體。"

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
