"of Titanium Skeletal Bracing CBM, stored on a data card of proprietary form-"
"factor, designed to be used extensively by an Autodoc, and allowing bionic "
"installation with minimal failure chance.  Integrated security subroutine "
"renders it unusable after installation."
msgstr ""
"用於安裝 <info>鈦製骨架支撐CBM</info> "
"的精確分步說明和相應需求資料，儲存於專門格式的數據卡上，被廣泛的設計用於自動醫生，可以使安裝生化插件的風險近乎於無。安裝使用後無法再次使用。"

