msgstr "痾, 你喝不了那東西! "

#: src/consumption.cpp
msgid "Eww.  Inedible plant stuff!"
msgstr "噁。這堆植物玩意兒不能吃! "

#: src/consumption.cpp
msgid "The thought of eating that makes you feel sick."
msgstr "光是想到要吃它就讓你覺得不舒服。"

#: src/consumption.cpp
msgid "You can't eat this."
msgstr "你不能吃這個。"

#: src/consumption.cpp
msgid "That doesn't look useable as fuel."
msgstr ""

