msgid "Quench burning charcoal"
msgstr "熄滅燃燒中的木炭"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
msgid ""
"Quenching will stop smoking process, but also destroy all used charcoal."
msgstr "熄滅火焰將停止煙燻, 但也會銷毀所有用過的木炭。"

